    "body": "References #2030.\n\n**KEEP: 175/512 → 177/512 complete correct replies on the unchanged frozen panel.**\nNine gained, seven lost,168 retained. Full512 saved175 baseline outputs match exactly before training; the saved/reloaded sole256-update endpoint reaches lineage832.\n\n**Line: cross-state continuation · count 0/3 · headline 175/512 → 177/512.**\nNo preparation PR. Pre-registration: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/2030#issuecomment-6097748714.\n\nThis run continues the successful episode-bottleneck objective from exact saved175 fractional masters with fresh Adam. Only115,200 existing Q4 cross-state coefficients learn; upstream fields, scorer, labels, objective and schedule stay fixed. The code change adds a strictly pinned saved175 resume profile and two meaningful tests. Phase-balanced saved145/saved175 requests reject.\n\nThe +2 net gain is mixed: entry340→298, teacher tokens3523→3304/6664, complete swap pairs35→32 and reassert34→32 regress. Length8 improves8→11/128 and evaluation equal-episode mean token CE falls3.484735→3.206871. All ten retained predecessor comparisons and exact row changes are preserved.335 complete replies fail; target256 and subsequent fresh40% remain unmet, fresh NOT_RUN.\n\n**If this came out the other way, would my next step differ? Yes.** A non-gain retains175 and advances count1/3; this gain retains177/count0. After protected delivery and cleanup, pre-register a distinct model-changing intervention from177; the small gain does not justify automatic unchanged-dose continuation. Preserve175 and all predecessors. Closed ordinary24/96, phase-balanced continuation and constructor/attribution/solver lines stay closed.\n\nValidation: producer25b36a074 has19 focused tests, optimized build and independent source review PASS; actual model process exited0 after769.143s. Independent saved-evidence review PASS, including direct remote artifact hashes. Final exact-head checks/review will be posted before queueing; transport acknowledgements are not tests.\n\nFull package135,495,680B is preserved in iCloud with complete readback MD5 `efb0195a8143d92bd4826ecefe748564` and standard index readback PASS. No local archive. Canonical record: `docs/labs/m2-bottleneck-resume-2026-10-10/README.md`; current-state, README, STATUS and ROADMAP updated. Model process peakRSS792956KiB, sampledGPU824MiB. Full-cycle projection90min/about$1.785; final inclusive accounting, protected merge/tree proof, cleanup and pod deletion follow on #2030.\n",
